# Seed saving: when seed of each crop is ripe on this site (onion: summer of its second year).
[] a perma:SeasonWindow ; perma:atSite id:site-permademo ; perma:forCrop id:crop-courgette ;
   perma:activity perma:SaveSeed ; perma:fromMonth 9 ; perma:toMonth 9 ;
   perma:confirmation perma:ToConfirm ; perma:basis "general practice (invented site)" .
[] a perma:SeasonWindow ; perma:atSite id:site-permademo ; perma:forCrop id:crop-sweet-pepper ;
   perma:activity perma:SaveSeed ; perma:fromMonth 9 ; perma:toMonth 10 ;
   perma:confirmation perma:ToConfirm ; perma:basis "general practice (invented site)" .
[] a perma:SeasonWindow ; perma:atSite id:site-permademo ; perma:forCrop id:crop-dill ;
   perma:activity perma:SaveSeed ; perma:fromMonth 8 ; perma:toMonth 9 ;
   perma:confirmation perma:ToConfirm ; perma:basis "general practice (invented site)" .
[] a perma:SeasonWindow ; perma:atSite id:site-permademo ; perma:forCrop id:crop-white-mustard ;
   perma:activity perma:SaveSeed ; perma:fromMonth 7 ; perma:toMonth 8 ;
   perma:confirmation perma:ToConfirm ; perma:basis "general practice (invented site)" .

# Added 2026-10-09 with the second set of recipes. Perennial herbs: leaves all year.
